00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.090
- To me the Klan is
basically a family tradition.

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.030
If you think about it, I mean,

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:06.780
at one time in America,

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:08.790
