talking to my dad this morning

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:15.620
- [Chris] But it was a popular thing.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.510
- [Interviewer] He was
saying it was a big deal

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.093
when he was a kid, in Indiana.

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.064
- [Chris] Oh

00:00:20.064 --> 00:00:21.336
- [Interviewer] He went to Purdue.

00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:23.220
- [Chris] Yeah he was in
D.C. Stephenson state.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.790
