00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.500
D.C. Stephenson.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.920
He ran it then.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.143
Yeah, I can imagine.

00:00:31.606 --> 00:00:34.079
I might make me a cloth through this satin

00:00:34.079 --> 00:00:35.915
- [Member] Too much material.

00:00:35.915 --> 00:00:37.660
- [Chris] I know.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.493
