00:00:43.715 --> 00:00:44.580
- [Member] It's warm.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.413
- This one's real hot

00:00:45.413 --> 00:00:46.983
- [Member] It'll be good in winter though.

00:00:47.844 --> 00:00:49.470
- I remember when I was
younger and I got my first robe

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.470
but I got one in cotton
and all the officers

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:52.940
