00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.240
It'll be hotter than hell.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.800
Then being an Imperial Wizard,
you got to have one in Satin.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:03.261
- [Interviewer] So what
is the difference between

00:01:03.261 --> 00:01:05.490
a Grand Dragon and an Imperial Wizard?

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:09.450
- Imperial Wizard's over the
whole Klan, the whole group.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.880
And the Grand Dragon is over the State.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.700
Like he's the Grand
Dragon of North Carolina.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:16.293
The man over there is the
Grand Dragon from Florida.

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:21.000
So each clan has Grand
Dragons over the State.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.470
And then under them, they
have 'Exalted Cyclops'

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.670
which is presidents of
each individual unit.

00:01:27.313 --> 00:01:30.303
- [Interviewer] And you've
been in the clan for how long?

00:01:30.303 --> 00:01:32.180
- About 23, 24 years. I joined in 1997.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.150
I know that (chuckles)

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:36.183
- [Interviewer] How'd
you join, what happened?

00:01:36.183 --> 00:01:38.230
- Well, I was at a Walmart one day

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:40.120
and a guy walked up handed me a flyer,

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.550
telling me that there was a
Klan rally right up the road

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:44.850
and wanting to know if I would attend it.

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.140
I had a Confederate flag shirt on

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.900
and I guess that's the reason
why he gave me the flyer.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.683
So I wound up attending the rally.

00:01:52.136 --> 00:01:54.660
And to me, at first I was skeptic

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:55.950
because you hear all the bad stuff

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.850
about the Klan killing
people and all that.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.530
So, I got a flyer while I was there

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:02.320
for the next rally
telling me when to come.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.810
It was basically the invitation to show

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.640
to people at the gate on how to get in

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.201
because without the
paper I couldn't get in

00:02:08.201 --> 00:02:09.034
because I wasn't a member.

00:02:09.034 --> 00:02:11.470
So the second rally was, I think it was

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:15.020
within a month after I
went back again, just to

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:17.610
hang out mingle with the
people, see what they're about.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.950
And when I got done listening
to a lot of the speeches

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.290
I felt, you know, they
believed the same way I do.

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.520
So that's what made me join.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.320
I mean, they're against drugs,

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:27.950
We're against abortion,
homosexuality, race mixing,

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.640
and everything in the Bible
is basically the same thing

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.170
the Klan clan was talking about.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:35.100
The clan was telling me, you
know, race mixing is wrong,

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.360
Homosexuality is wrong, but
all this is in the Bible

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.010
and that's one thing I
liked about the Klan is

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.610
they were showing me where
to find it at in the Bible.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.370
And you know, I've been
to a lot of churches

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:46.050
and most of the churches
are 501(c)(3) churches

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.020
they're owned by the government,
ran by the government.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.600
They're told what to preach.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.710
So a lot of the verses
they were showing me in the

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.170
King James version of the Bible,

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.320
was verses I've never seen or heard.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.400
So it shocked me and I
found it very knowledgeable,

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.090
So I kept going to the rallies
and I kept reading the Bible

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.320
and then wound up becoming
a member of the KU Klux Klan

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.480
in 1997.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:07.150
And I think by the summer,

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:08.390
yeah by the time summer was over

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:11.190
I was a full-blown member of the KKK.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.710
And I don't regret a bit of it.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.450
I mean, I've loved the clan
and I'll always love the clan

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.570
and do whatever I can to help it grow.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.347
