00:03:19.347 --> 00:03:20.210
behind the Ku Klux Klan?

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:23.770
- Basic belief behind the KU
Klux Klan is that, you know

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:26.410
as a race as a whole, we
need to stick together.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:28.190
All the other races are sticking together.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.170
You have, you know, groups
for the African-Americans,

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:36.170
