Lives Matter, you got NAACP.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.750
But if you look, there is
no white groups out there

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.880
to support white people.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.620
That will actually stick up
and stand for white people

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.020
and help them out when in need,

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:46.040
you know, the nigger, the Mexicans,

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.390
they can all run to the
government and get loans

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.670
