a white man can't do it.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.620
It's impossible basically
for whites to go out

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:54.340
and get these services.

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:57.230
So the clan to me, it's
always stood there to help

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.820
white people who are in need
and I'll always support it.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:02.600
And I think the Klan
is a great organization

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:06.280
and it's been here 150 years
in support of the white race.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.530
And right now in America,
the way things are going

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.870
